---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import FinalCta from '../components/FinalCta.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
const crumbs = [{ label: 'Privacy Policy' }];
---
<Base
  title="Privacy Policy | The Williams Law Firm"
  description="How The Williams Law Firm collects, uses and protects information submitted through this website."
  crumbs={crumbs}
>
  <PageHero eyebrow="Legal" title="Privacy policy" lede="How information you share through this website is handled." mark="Privacy" crumbs={crumbs} cta={false} trust={false} />
  <section class="section bg-paper">
    <div class="wrap prose measure">
      <p><em>Draft for attorney review before publication.</em></p>
      <h2>Information you provide</h2>
      <p>
        When you submit the consultation request form, the firm receives the information you enter: your name, phone
        number, email address, the general type of legal matter and your preferred contact method. The form
        intentionally does not ask for details about your case.
      </p>
      <h3>How it is used</h3>
      <p>
        This information is used only to respond to your enquiry and to arrange a consultation. It is not sold, and it
        is not shared with third parties except service providers that help deliver the message to the firm, or where
        required by law.
      </p>
      <h3>No attorney-client relationship</h3>
      <p>
        Submitting a form, sending an email or calling the firm does not by itself create an attorney-client
        relationship. Please do not send confidential or time-sensitive information until such a relationship has been
        established in writing.
      </p>
      <h3>Website data</h3>
      <p>
        Like most websites, this site’s hosting provider may automatically log technical information such as your IP
        address, browser type and the pages you visit. This site does not use advertising cookies.
      </p>
      <h3>Links to other sites</h3>
      <p>
        This site links to third-party services, including Google, where the firm’s reviews are published. Those
        services have their own privacy policies.
      </p>
      <h3>Contact</h3>
      <p>
        Questions about this policy, or requests to correct or delete information you submitted, can be sent to
        <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> or made by phone at <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phoneDisplay}</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <FinalCta />
</Base>
